.TH ZDOTS-MAN-GEN 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-man-gen \- Generate man(1) pages for bin/ commands from their \-\-help output.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-man-gen --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: zdots-man-gen [--check]

Generate man(1) pages for bin/ commands from their --help output.
Curated pages in man/man1 + man/man8 are never overwritten — this fills gaps.

  --check     List commands with no man page and exit 1 (CI mode; writes nothing)
  -h, --help  Show this help
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
